      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manly%2C_Iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors Central of Iowa freight agent J.C., who helped establish the junction that became Manly.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
